<title>USA: Thor Industries Q1 sales down. [CORRECTED 20:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>Thor Industries Q1 sales down. [CORRECTED 20:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON CENTER, Ohio 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thor Industries Inc said Monday its preliminary sales for the quarter ended October 31 were $150.2 million compared with $151.5 million for the first quarter last year.</p>
<p>The company said recreational vehicle sales were down due to the shutdown of two unprofitable (corrects from profitable) plants, production problems at another facility and flat industry shipments.</p>
<p>But the company said small and mid-size bus sales were up 23 percent.</p>
</text>
